The second form is safer and more likely true broadly.

________________________________
4. Third upgrade: prove an information upper bound

The most general theorem should probably be an upper bound, not an equality.

For bounded reward [cid:image107.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] , a plausible targe=
t is:
[cid:image108.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090]

if is measured in nats. If measured in bits, the constant picks up [cid:ima=
ge110.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] :
[cid:image111.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090]

This comes from a standard route:

  1.  The value of observation is bounded by how far the joint distribution=
 [cid:image112.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] is from the product distribution [cid=
:image113.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] .
  2.  That distance can be controlled by total variation.
  3.  Total variation can be bounded by KL divergence.
  4.  KL divergence between [cid:image112.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] and [cid:i=
mage113.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] is mutual information.

So the theorem shape becomes:

Theorem B =E2=80=94 Information upper bound on feedback value.
For any bounded admission-control utility [cid:image107.png@01DD19E9.0FB000=
90] , the improvement of any causal controller using delayed observation [c=
id:image114.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] over the best static policy satisfies
[cid:image115.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090]

for an explicit constant [cid:image116.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] , with [cid:i=
mage117.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] in the Markov one-sample case and [cid:image=
118.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] in the general history case.

This gives you the big philosophical result:

If delayed information contains no predictive information about the present=
, feedback control has no value.

That is the general form of your impossibility theorem.

Your current infocom<https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/att-my.sharepoint.c=
om/personal/aq0842_att_com/_layouts/15/viewer.aspx?sourcedoc=3D*7b6d7d20b6-=
11eb-483a-a631-c464aa4a2784*7d__;JSU!!BhdT!hE_QRMqHbUObrfJvnkR6vfiATP5UB4Q3=
maoh5shaQbkubeTruPluqIsaGNUheStVQAK58oHneQIpSSCtAjtavA$> says the value of =
feedback is set by freshness relative to coherence time in the binary Marko=
v model and notes that general cases require a broader condition such as mi=
xing rather than autocorrelation alone. The mutual-information theorem woul=
d subsume that idea. [infocom | PDF]<https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/att=
-my.sharepoint.com/personal/aq0842_att_com/Documents/Microsoft*20Copilot*20=
Chat*20Files/infocom.pdf?web=3D1__;JSUl!!BhdT!hE_QRMqHbUObrfJvnkR6vfiATP5UB=
4Q3maoh5shaQbkubeTruPluqIsaGNUheStVQAK58oHneQIpSSAUph6buQ$>, [infocom | PDF=
]<https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/att-my.sharepoint.com/personal/aq0842_=
att_com/Documents/Microsoft*20Copilot*20Chat*20Files/infocom.pdf?web=3D1__;=
JSUl!!BhdT!hE_QRMqHbUObrfJvnkR6vfiATP5UB4Q3maoh5shaQbkubeTruPluqIsaGNUheStV=
QAK58oHneQIpSSAUph6buQ$>

________________________________
5. Fourth upgrade: prove exact equality for special decision classes

After the bound, pursue equality cases.

The exact equality will likely require a specific utility and a restricted =
family of observation channels. For example:

Case 1: binary symmetric state, symmetric admission utility

You recover:
[cid:image119.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090]

This is your current theorem rewritten.

Case 2: finite-state capacity with threshold admission

Let capacity be [cid:image120.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090] . Decompose it into bi=
nary layers:
[cid:image121.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090]

Then prove a layer-wise information bound:
[cid:image122.png@01DD19E9.0FB00090]

This connects naturally to the layer-cake reduction already present in the =
paper=E2=80=99s framing of pod caps and marginal resource units. infocom<ht=
tps://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/att-my.sharepoint.com/personal/aq0842_att_=
com/_layouts/15/viewer.aspx?sourcedoc=3D*7b6d7d20b6-11eb-483a-a631-c464aa4a=
2784*7d__;JSU!!BhdT!hE_QRMqHbUObrfJvnkR6vfiATP5UB4Q3maoh5shaQbkubeTruPluqIs=
aGNUheStVQAK58oHneQIpSSCtAjtavA$> already treats politeness at the marginal=
 contended unit and discusses lifting beyond the binary unit setting. [info=
com | PDF]<https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/att-my.sharepoint.com/persona=
l/aq0842_att_com/Documents/Microsoft*20Copilot*20Chat*20Files/infocom.pdf?w=
eb=3D1__;JSUl!!BhdT!hE_QRMqHbUObrfJvnkR6vfiATP5UB4Q3maoh5shaQbkubeTruPluqIs=
aGNUheStVQAK58oHneQIpSSAUph6buQ$>, [infocom | PDF]<https://urldefense.com/v=
