:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Then prove a layer-wise information bound=
:</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-bottom:12.0p=
t;line-height:15.0pt">
<img border=3D"0" width=3D"194" height=3D"54" style=3D"width:2.0166in;heigh=
