<p style=3D"line-height:15.0pt"><span style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-family=
:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">This connects naturally to the layer-cake=
 reduction already present in the paper=E2=80=99s framing of pod caps and m=
arginal resource units.
